"Ben 10 Ultimate Alien Cosmic Destruction All Regions"
Pausa el juego e introduce los siguientes trucos para el efecto deseado
CASH - 1 Million DNA cash
HARD - Deal half damage, take double damage
ENERGY - Energy
HEALTH - Health
LEVELS - Unlock all levels
CLASSIC - Unlock Fourarms
PRIMUS - Unlock Rath
UPGRADE - Upgrade everything to max

